{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/ae54c92ecaa803457b9610a7535080fc.avif?t=1773250656\" width=1280 height=362 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit Historical Figures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your time machine to bring iconic characters from history into battle. Each character has unique perks, and stacking the right combinations creates devastating team synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/a6d3c2c0fe4136751b8795b062a7e5d4.poster.avif?t=1773250656\" width=744 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/a6d3c2c0fe4136751b8795b062a7e5d4.webm?t=1773250656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/a6d3c2c0fe4136751b8795b062a7e5d4.mp4?t=1773250656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Auto-Battler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your strategy, position your heroes, and watch spectacular chaotic battles unfold automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/95d0b5be199e27578d8f35d1dab1c41a.poster.avif?t=1773250656\" width=744 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/95d0b5be199e27578d8f35d1dab1c41a.webm?t=1773250656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/95d0b5be199e27578d8f35d1dab1c41a.mp4?t=1773250656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear Up Your Squad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit shops along your journey to buy upgrades and equip your heroes with gear that shapes their power and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/bd06e505c4d12a0100ee327e01fda005.poster.avif?t=1773250656\" width=744 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/bd06e505c4d12a0100ee327e01fda005.webm?t=1773250656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/bd06e505c4d12a0100ee327e01fda005.mp4?t=1773250656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to two friends and outsmart your foes together. Trade equipment, optimize each other\u2019s builds, and unleash devastating tactical combos against escalating threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/5569e42a2acb381dc5f4cfb4286dfa69.poster.avif?t=1773250656\" width=744 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/5569e42a2acb381dc5f4cfb4286dfa69.webm?t=1773250656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/5569e42a2acb381dc5f4cfb4286dfa69.mp4?t=1773250656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Traveling Voyage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through time, visiting Ancient Egypt, the Italian Renaissance, and other extraordinary places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/bd39d19143ff9e1b0a44c90733c60aea.poster.avif?t=1773250656\" width=744 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/bd39d19143ff9e1b0a44c90733c60aea.webm?t=1773250656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/bd39d19143ff9e1b0a44c90733c60aea.mp4?t=1773250656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your HQ</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each mission, upgrade your headquarters to expand your roster, develop cutting-edge gadgets, and enhance your team\u2019s capabilities for the next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/f02ddb054cb2086a95e835926c3e303c.poster.avif?t=1773250656\" width=744 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/f02ddb054cb2086a95e835926c3e303c.webm?t=1773250656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/f02ddb054cb2086a95e835926c3e303c.mp4?t=1773250656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the ultimate showdown: a final battle to save humanity from monstrous invaders in this epic last stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950410/extras/7337f80171511be73